config ANDROID_BPF_FD_LOADER
	tristate "Android BPF FD Loader Driver"
	depends on BPF_SYSCALL && RUST
	help
	  This option enables the Android BPF FD Loader driver.
	  The loader provides an IOCTL interface on /dev/android_bpf_loader
	  to load BPF programs and maps using BPF light skeletons from a file
	  descriptor passed by userspace.
